  abstract = {With an assumption of classical algebraic geometry being covered (up to book 1 of Shafarevich' Basic Algebraic Geometry and Michael Atiyah's Commutative Algebra), this book will hold my Modern Algebraic Geometry Knowledge. The first part is dedicated to the basics: sheaf theory, schemes and their properties, cohomology of quasicoherent sheaves, and partial applications to curves and modules. Further parts shall focus on more specialized topics}
